<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">EPH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">EPH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">EPH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">EPH - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPH - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Zhu ri Bulus, riwa ri ti Izhi a he nji ri ndu Yeso Kristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Ri wa hu Izhi ri meme Afisa, wawa wa kpa nyɨme ri sron mba ri kabru tu ri Yeso kristo<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />No Ti mbu Izhi nga Bachi Yeso Kristo no yi dindi ti nga sisron.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tilɨbu ri Yuu Rimi Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />No ta ki ngɨri ri Izhi nga Ti Bachi Yeso Kristo, ritu ri kabru tu mbu ri Kristo a tilɨbu sro ta ri no ta wawu tilɨbu ri Yuu rimi kpanchi wan ri shu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ka wa ran ti gbungblu mme rina, Izhi a zhu ta ki he wa ma hu ri kabru tu mbu ri Kristo, ritu riwa ki ri he Tsitsri nga ki ri ran ti meme ti kya kusi wan ran. Ritu nyɨme wan <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Izhi ka dzi ri hu ri Yeso Kristo, ri wawu ri no ta ki he miriron nga mirimba wan ritu bibi ri dindi ti ri suu wan. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Ki gbre Izhi ritu nkpen dindi ti wan, ritu ide ri huri ri vren wan. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ritu yii Kristo wa kpata chuwo, wa ka meme ti mbu chuwo. Nkpen dindi ti Izhi he ri se, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />riwa a no ta ri nkon ri gra ri wawu wiwri wan ri towan. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Izhi a ti kya riwa a yosron, ran no ta ki to yayɨbi kyawa riwa a kadzi riwa a ri ti kre ri Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Rinyi he rimi ti riwa Izhi ka dzi riwa ari no vi no sho,ran ka kyawa kabru wawu rimi Kristo, wawu kya wan riwa a he ri shu nga ri mme.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ritu kabru tu ri Kristo, Izhi chu ta ngawen no ta ki kpa kya riwa a ka dzi ri wawu ri no ta, a kadzi sisenmu riwa ari ti ngamba, a kre kongye bibi riwa a ka dzi rimi sron wan, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Ritu kita nji Yahuda wawa ki gbuchi yo sron ri kristo, ki gbre nkpen Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ngha biyi ngawen wawa bi he wanji Izhi riwa bi wo tre ri kpunji tre, itre dindi riwa a ngɨzhi kpachuwo ye ri yi, bi kpanyɨme ri Yeso nga Izhi yo wo riwa nji ri kpi ritu mbi riwa a no yi Yuu Tsitsri riwa a ran ka tre dzi. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Iyu Tsitsri nye he jiji gado mbu hi chachu riwa ki fe wu, rinyi ngawen he ritu gbre nkpen wan nye.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngiri Ngha Bre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ritu nganyi, ranronmu me wo yo sron mbi rimi Bachi Yeso nga nyɨme mbi riwa bi nyɨme nyi wawa wa he wa Izhi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />me ran ka ngɨri ri Izhi chuwo ri tumbi ran. me taka mbi rimi ibrewon. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ri Yosron ri Izhi riwa Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo, A ti riwa wa gbre wu, a no yi Yuu riwa ari de wiwiri ri la yi to Izhi bran. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Me ibre ngawen no sron mbi no bu ran kpan, riwa bi to kya riwa bi yo sron ritu yo riwa a yo yi, bibi wo ri ti sisri riwa a ka tre dzi ri wa nji wan, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />nga bibi gbengbren wan rigra rimi ndu wan ri ta wawa ki kpa gbengbren nyi riwa a ti tindu rimi mbu a he riri ri bibi sen kpa ri gra, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />riwa a ta Yeso shɨme rimi kuu riwu, ran no bubu son ku wo ri wan ri shu. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kristo he ri gbengbren ri senkpa, nga kpanchi son kyawa wawa wa ti wa ri shu nga meme ngawen. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Izhi ka kongye ri ndo dza Kristo, nga ran ka-u no wa hu Izhi no he tu riwa a ngɨzhi kongye wawu, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Riwa wa he ri kpa Kristo, riwa a ka kyawa shu ko kutan kyuwan.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Zhuu Ri Kuu hi ri Son ri Sii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Ri sen biyi wawa bi ran to Izhi ran bi kuu rimi Yuu ritu ka wo tre ri sentumbi nga meme ti, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Wawa bi ran he rimi wan ri sen, bi hu kyawa wa gbengbren ri shu, wa to ngungu nyi riwa a ri zhuu rimi sron wa ka tre Izhi wo <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Kita wawu ki he ka wawa ki kii ri hu mbye bibi wambi nji, ki ti kya riwa ikpa ri sron wa wa, hari bi ri ri hu sron mbi lele nye ifu Izhi he ri tu mbu, biyi ngbron nji. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ama ilosron Izhi a kigbu, nga nyɨme wan rita a he nkpen mbi mba. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Riwa ki kuu rimi Yu ri ka wo mbu a ngɨzhi ta ye ri si ri Kristo. A he rimi dindi ti nye a kpa yi chuwo. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Rimi kabru mbu ri Kristo Yeso a tata shɨme ri wawu ran no ta ki kii ri kpanchison wan ri shu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />A ti rinyi no tsro ta ri vi wawu ri nzan riwa ari ye a tsro dindi tiwan bibi wan ran he ran, ritu tsro ta dindi ti Zu riwo Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ritu dindi ti Izhi nye wa kpayi chuwo ritu yo sron a ran he ritu gbengbren mbi ran a he ide riwa Izhi nye, riwa njo ran kpo ngwan ran. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Aran he ritu ndu mbi ran, riwa njo ri kpo ngawan ran. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Kita ki he wandu Izhi, riwa wati ta rimi Yeso Kristo no ta ki tindu dindi, riwa Izhi ti zi ri ta kusi mu riwa ki ti.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki he Riri Rimi Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Biyi wawa bi ran he nji Yahuda ri ngɨzhi ran riwa wa yo yi,&lt;&lt;Biyi wa wa wa ran fon yi nju ran&gt;&gt; Ran tre ri&lt;&lt;Ri nji Yahuda wa wa wa yo ngamba ri,&gt;&gt;Wa wa wa fon nju riwa wa kɨma-u ti kya riwa nji wa ti ri kpa mba tika kya ri wa bi he ri sen. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Taka chachu mba, bi he kpata ri Kristo. Bi he gran bi ran he wawa Izhi a chu yi ran, bi he tsren bi ran he rimi miri alakauri ran, ri wa a he rimi tre dzi ri wa Izhi ritu miri wan, ri wa bi ki ri gbungblu me nyi mba yo sron mba Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ama zizan, ri katu kabru mbi ri Yeso Kristo, biyi riwa bi ran he kpata wa ngɨzhi yi ye ku san ri yii riwa Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Wawu Kristo ri tuwan ngɨzhi si sron ye wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran ti riri. Ri kpa wan a yira kankan ri wa a ga wa ti hari ran no wa he kpan fu ngamba. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />A dzi doka ri nji Yahuda ri wa doka wan rimi de kpa wan, ritu wan nye a ngɨzhi nji ri sisa dzu ri wo nji hari, ngamba nye a ngɨzhi son ri sisron ye. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Ngha ran ka wa dzon tu haha mba ri Izhi, no wa he kpa riri, ritu konkron riwa wa kpan-u, ngamba nye a chu fu zho ri tsutsu mba. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Imba kristo a ngɨzhi tre dindi ye ri yi biyi wawa bi he kpata ri Izhi nga nji Yahuda, wawa wa he hyure ri wu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ritu wan nye haha mbu ki fe zhuu ri A ti ritu nkon Yuu riri <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Ashe, biyi bi ran he gran ngaran, ko ka tsren, ai bi he wa kpan wawa ki ki wawa wa Tsitsri wa ko Izhi, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />wawa wa mme wa ri nchinchi wawa wati ndu iwa wandu Izhi, Kristo Yeso kyuwan wawu nye he tita ri nju tra riwa wa mme. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Itra riwa wa mme wa kabru tu wa ri mme, a he tra ri Tsitsri riwa Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Rimi Yeso nye bi yi ngawen wawa me no yi he bubu son Izhi dzu ri wo Yuu.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a tre tre Izhi ri wawa Wa ran he nji Yahuda ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ritu ngamba, ame Bulus riwa wa tren wen ritu Yeso Kristo ritu biyi wawa bi ran he nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Kpunji riwa bi wo ri Izhi rimi dindi ti wan a no wen ndu nyi meti ritu no bi ri yi, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Me ngaa riyi tsawen ri, Izhi zhu ri kya riwa a riri ran bu ri mo no wen to-u. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Inde bi kra kya riwa me ngaa, bi to kya riwa me to ri kya ri yayɨbi riwa Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Ri vi riwa wa vuyɨba wa ran la kyawa wa yayɨbi ri wa ran, ama Izhi bu wa riwa dzu riwo Tsitsri wandu Izhi ri wa la tre Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Yayɨbi kya nyi wa he riwa ritu tre tre Izhi wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran wa he kpan gado rita, igbɨrekpa riri, wa kpan ka bru nga ka tre dzi rimi Yeso Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Wa yo wen me he nji riwa me tre tre Izhi nyi, ritu ide ri dindi ti riwa Izhi riwa wati ri mo rimi gbengbren. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ame riwa tsitsri won he fiwen han wa ko ngaan, ame nye wa no wen dindi ti nyi no wen tre tre Izhi ri wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran ritu bibi wo riwa Kristo he ri wu riwa wa ran to bla ran, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />nga meri tsro nji wawu bibi tre ri yayɨbi riwa a kru ri me ise ri se riwo Izhi, wawu riwa a ngɨzhi <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Wa ti rinyi zizan ritu riwa no wa la bibi to riwa Izhi he riwu kankankan ri wa la tre Izhi ri wa gbengbren ri shu, ri nkon wawa wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Izhi ti rinyi ritu wan wan riwa a ran kre ran, riwa a ka dzi dzu riwo Yeso Kristo Bachi mbu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ri wu Kristo nye ki fe nkon hi ri Izhi, ri kpa nyɨme mbu kusi wan. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Me ibreyi, vu sron, ran ti sisiri ritu ya riwa me ti ritu mbi ran, a he gbre mbi nye.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibre won Bulus Ritu Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ritu nganyi, me kɨbu ngbazhu me ri bre kusi A ti mbu, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Wawu riwa ari yo nde ri bla ri me ri shu nga meme. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Me bre Izhi no no yi bibi de riwa a he rimi gbɨre wan, no no yi Iyu ri mkpen gbengben ri sron mbi, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />me ibreno Kristo no son ri sron mbi ritu kpanyɨme mbi, nga me ibreno nyɨme no son ri ko wan bran rimi sron mbi. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Me bre Izhi ritu biyi, ri wanji riwa Izhi, bi ri fe gbengbren riwa bi to bibi bran nga gbron, bibi dzen nga nkpen nyɨme riwa kristo he ri wu. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Bi ri to bibi nyɨme riwa Bachi he ri wu ri ta, riwa a han gbengbren to nga riwa wa shu yi ri sho riwa Izhi.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Nkpen he ri nji riwa a he ri gbengbren han kya riwa ki bre wawu, ko ka, ki ti rimi gbengbren wan riwa a he ri sron mbu, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Nkpen he wa Izhi ritu wawa wa hu Izhi nga ri Yeso Kristo bla vi, hi ri kremkpen ri krenmkpen! No he ngamba.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ki he Riri Rimi Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ritu nganyi, ame riwa wa tren wen ritu Bachi, me ibreyi no yi son riwa a tsra ri bibi yo riwa Bachi yo yi. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ka tu mbi yo ri meme, rere, nga vu sron. Tsro nyɨme mbi ri ngambi. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ti kya riwa bi to ti bi ri mɨlan son mbi riwa itu mbi no he riri, bi kabru rimi si sron. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Ikpa riri nga Yuu riri nye he bibi riwa iyo sron riri riwa Izhi yo yi-a. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Bachi riri nye he, iyo sron riri, isontu ima riri. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Izhi riri nga A ti ri wawu, riwa a he Bachi ri Wawu, ari tindu zu rimi wawu,<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ama ko ngaan mbi kpa dindi ti bibi senkpa riwa Kristo de. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Bibi riwa imbe ri tre ri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Yeso a hi ri shu mu, a vu wawa wa tren wa ri ngawan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">ran no nji kyawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Zizan, riwa wa tre ri,&lt;&lt; A hi ri shu-a&gt;&gt; Ri tre, ri sen, a gɨzhi ye ri meme? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Riwa a ye meme, a he riri ri riwa a hi rishu, ri shu nga ri meme, riwa a ri shu ri shu nga ko ngye. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />A zhu wari no wa he wa tindu Izhi, wari wa la tre Izhi, wari wa tre tre Izhi, nga wa tsro tre Izhi, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ritu no wa nji Izhi no wa fe no wa to tindu riwa wa hu Izhi, ritu riwa wa mme kpa Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />riwa kita wawu mbu ki ran kabru kiri he riri rimi yo sron mbu nga to mbu riwa Yeso, ki he wawa ki yi kpa, nga ki ri to bibi nkpen riwa Kristo he riwu.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Wati rinyi ritu no ta ki ran bru he ka imiri ngaran, riwa gungu ri vu wa ran fu wa rega ritu tsro mba riwa wa gyuru nji ri bibi ti mba. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ritu nganyi, no ta ki la kpunji ritu nyɨme ki ran gbron rimi wan ko rimi nkon ritan wa to Kristo, wawu riwa a he nji riwa ari ngɨzhi ta. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />A no wa hu Izhi no wa gbron rimi Yuu mba, wari ngɨzhi-u rimi zon riwa ko igbre ritan rimi mba ri zon ko ritan ri zon kpa ri gbron, ran ri zon ri nyɨme.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ison Sisa Rimi Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Me la yi, me kawon ri la yi rimi nde Bachi, ran he ka bibi son wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran, wawa wa he ri rimɨren ri kuklu. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Isron mba ti bu, wa he graan ri tu son riwa Izhi ri de, ritu to riwa wa ran to ran he riwa, ritu sentu mba. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Isron mba he gbingbindri, wa gra rimi ti kya ri shan, wa gru si rimi ti meme ti.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />A ran he ngamba nye wa tsro yi ri nkon Kristo ran. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Wari tre ri bi srenton riwu, wari tsro yi ri wo wan nye, bibi riwa kpunji tre riwa Kristo he. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Bi kpanyɨme ri bibi ti mbi risen, riwa bi he rimi wan, riwa ari time ritu mbiye wan riwa ari gyuru nji. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Biyi sran sron mbi, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />ka sron sisa riwa wa ngɨzhi, ri bibi riwa wa ngɨzhi-u a he ka Izhi inga a ŋɨran ngawa rimi son ri kpunji riwa a tsra nga Tsitsri.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Iche ran he ngaran, biyi bi to ko ngaan ran la vayi wan kpunji tre, ritu ki he wambu wawu rimi kpa Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Inde bi ti fu, ran no fu mbi no ngɨzhi yi hi no yi ti meme ti ran, ran no fu mbi no he hi ri yawulu ran. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Ran ka nkon chuwo ri memenji ran. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />No nji ri yɨbi no ran bru yɨbi ran, tse no ran chu kpa ran ran tindu kpi nji ri wo wan, riwa ari fe kya riwa ari no wa ti ya.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />No gigla tre kyari no ran zhuu ri nyu mbi ran, tsede no he bibi tre riwa a tsra riwa ari zon nji, nowa tre, ran bru tre, ritu tiwan ari no kya dindi no he ri wawa wa wo-u. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Bi mɨlan ya, ran kpa sron Yuu ri Tsitsri riwa Izhi time ran, Iyu he alama kya riwa Izhi ri tumbi, ivi ri ye riwa Bachi ri kpata chuwo. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Bi ka ko bibi tre riwa a rii chuwo, ran yira njo ngaan ri fu ran, ran tifu ran, ran tre meme tre kya ritu njo ran, ran kawen ri njo ran. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Ti dindi ti ri ngambi, ran lo sron ri ngambi, bi ri ran ka meme ti ngambi rega bibi riwa Izhi ka meme ti mbu rega ri ta dzu ritu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ison Riwa ari Ngɨji Kpan ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Tunde bi he miri Izhi riwa a kpa nyɨme ri yi, dole bi he ka wawu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />kii bibi kii ri nyɨme riwa Kristo nyɨme ta nga ran ka ngawan de ritu mbu ka sraka ri ro, a ka ngawan de ritu sro yi ri ro ri Izhi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Tunde bi he wanji Izhi, no wa ran to yi ri wamba ran, ri ko bibi meme ti ri bibi tan ko itimbye rimi mbi, ritu kyawa wanyi wa ran bi ri wa Tsitsri wa Izhi ran. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ko meme tre, ri tre ri kuklu riwa a ran he no wa tre ran, tsede bi ka ran ngiri ri Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Biyi bi to tinyi, njo riwa a wamba vava nga riwa ari ti kya riwa tsra nga riwa a ri no nji shan ari he rimi nji wawa Izhi he chu ritu mba ko wawa wa wa kya riwa a han kya riwa wa wa, bibi nji wanyi wa nyɨme ri kpi mba han Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ran no njo gyuru yi ri meme tre, ritu kyawa wanyi nye ifu Izhi ri ye ritu wawa wana hu tre wan ran. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ritu ngamba, ran ti kyari kabru iwawa ran.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ritu risen, biyi bi he ri bu, ama zizan bi he kpan rimi Kristo. A he riwa bi he ka wawa wa he rimi kpan. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Ritu ikpan nye ri ngɨzhi kya riwa a tsra ye, wawa wa to kpunji riwa Izhi no wa ti kya riwa wa bi, dindi ti, Tsitsri nga kpunji. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Biyi ti kya riwa ari si Izhi sron. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />He kpata ri ndu ri bu kuklu ri riwa a ran he nkon ran, tsede bi ka ngaran wa zhu ra. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />A he kya ri shan no wa tre kyawa riwa wa ti ri yayɨbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ama ka wa ngɨzhi ko ngye ye rimi kpan, kyawa mba wawu bibi riwa wa he a zhu raa, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Ikya ri wa wa zhu riwu ri raa a kɨma he kpan. Ritu ngamba nye wa tre ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Wurunde biyi wawa bi kruna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">bi ri tashɨme rimi kuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">nga Kristo ri kpan ritu mbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ritu ngamba, ti rereri ki mbi, ran ki ka wawa wa ran ti wiwɨri ran, ama bibi wawa wa he ri wiwiri, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Tindu ri vi riwa bi he riwu, ritu ivi riwa ki he rimi wan a he vi ri meme ti. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ritu ngamba ran he wa ti nkpran ran, ama ti bi ri to kya riwa Bachi riwa no yi ti. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ran hua ri hi ran, riwa ari ngɨzhi yi ban mme, tsede bi ka shu ri Yuu Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Tre ri ngambi ri tre ri Zabura ri wa se ri gbre, nga wa se ri Yuu, bi ri ran chu se ri gbre ri Izhi ri sron mbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Sondu ran ngɨri ri A ti Izhi ritu ko ngye, rimi nde Bachi Yeso Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Hu ngambi ritu to mkpen riwa Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mba Ngha Ronron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Biyi mba, ka ngambi no wa ron mbi bibi riwa bi ka ngambi no Bachi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ritu ronron wawu nye ri gbengbren ritu wa wan bibi riwa Bachi he ri mgemgbren ritu wa hu Izhi, ikpa wan chuwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ritu ngamba, imba wa ka ngamba no wa ron mba ri nkponkpon bibi riwa wau Izhi wa ka ngamba no Bachi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Biyi ronron, nyɨme wa mba mbi bibi riwa Bachi nyɨme wa hu Izhi ran ka ngawan de ritu mba. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />A ti nganyi ritu no he Tsitsri, no he pianpian ritu ngla ri ima zu ri wɨlo tre Izhi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />riwa ari ka wa hu Izhi no ngawan rimi nkpen, janji ri bi, riwa a ran he ri ji ran ri ngbron kyawa riwa wa ran bi ran. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ritu ngamba a bi no ronron no wa nyɨme wa mbaa mba, ikpa mba nye wa ti ri wa nji riwa a nyɨme ri wa wan, a nyɨme ngawan nye mba. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Ritu njo ran kawan ri ngawan zari ran, tsede ka no ri ran milan-u ti bibi riwa Bachi ri ti ri wa hu Izhi; <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />kita ki he wa gbɨre kpa Yeso. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Ritu ngamba, nji ri ka iti wan nga yiwan don ran ka ngawan ngaan ri wa wan, haha mba wa he kpa riri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Inchon kya ri yayibi riwa wa bu rimi mbe Izhi nyi, ame me tre ritu Kristo nye ri wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Kau ri ngamba, ko ngaa ka nyɨme wa wan bibi riwa a nyɨme ngawan, nga no wa no no ron wan mkpen.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Imiri ri Wati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Biyi miri, wo tre wa timbi wawu nye tsra. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />&lt;&lt;No ti wen ri yi wen nkpen.&gt;&gt; Wawu nye he doka ri gbuchi ri ka tre dzi. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />&lt;&lt;Ritu no son mbi no bi ri yi, nga riwa bi ti vi hari ri mgbumgblume.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Biyi wati, ran kpa sron miri mbi time ran, tsede bi ka tsro wa nkon dindi bi ri ŋoron wa yo ri nkon Bachi.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Gran ri Wanji wa Ko mba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Biyi gran, hu tre wawa wa ngɨzhi yi ri mgbumgblu me ri nyi ri de nkpen ri ti sisiri, ri janji sron, bibi riwa wu ti ri hu Bachi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Wo tre mba, ran ti bibi riwa wari wa ti ritu wa ri ka don sii nji sron ran, tsede bi ka ti bibi riwa wa hu Izhi wa ti riwa Izhi kpa nyɨme ri wu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Ti ndu wen ri sron riri bibi riwa ka wu ti ri Bachi <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Bi to bibi dindi ti riwa nji ti, ko a he gran, ko a ran he gran ran, Bachi ri han wu.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Biyi wawa bi ngɨzhi gran, biyi ngawen ti ri wa bibi kya riwa wa ti ri yi, ran no wa sisiri ran, to yi wawu riwa a he Bachi mbu ri biyi ngawen, a he ri shu, a ran ri lala ran.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpi Iku Riwa Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ri kre wan, kri mgbemgben ri Bachi, ri gbengbren wan. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mɨlan ki ri kpi ku riwa Izhi, bi ri to vu meme nji. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Izran mbu ran he ritu nji ran, ama ritu meme Yuu wa shu wulu, ri kpanchi wawa gbungblume he ri wo mba. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ritu nganyi ban kpi ku mbi wawu riwa Izhi, riwa bi mɨlan ki ritu meme vi nyi, kugon riwa bi kre kongye wawu, bi ka ki gbengben. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Ritu ngamba, ki mgbemgben no kpunji no he ka ntan ri lo tri mbi, no dindi ti mbi no he gbengbren mbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Ngɨzhi tre Izhi riwa ari ngɨzhi sisron ye no he ka ntan dza ri dza mbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Rimi wan wawu, ban gblukpa ri yosron, riwa bi to yɨbi nzan wulu ri meme-a ri wu. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />No Yuu Izhi no he ka tsro tu ri ku mbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ti rinyi wawu rimi bre, no Izhi no dzon yi. Bre bla vi bibi riwa Iyu Izhi la yi ritu nganyi, sondu ran srenton ran chu sron zho ran, sondu bre ri nji wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Bi ri bre ri mo ngawen, no Izhi no no wen tre ri vi riwa me tre, riwa me tre ri senkpa won meri dzu ri tre Izhi riwa a he ri rɨrɨ-a. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Riwa me he nji riwa wa ti wen ndu zizan riwa me he ri tra tren nji. Bre ri mo inde me tre tre Izhi me ka tre ri gbengbren me ran ti sisri ran.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichi Bulus ri Krenkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Zizan, riwa bi to sikpa won, ri bibi he riwa me he rimi wan, ngye Tikikus, vayi riwa me nyɨme-u, wawu nji riwa ari tindu Izhi ri sron riri, a ri la yi kongye. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Me ti-u ndu ri yi ritu no yi to bibi riwa ki he, no no yi gbengbren sron. <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Dindi ti riwa Izhi A ti ri riwa Bachi Yeso Kristo no wa he ri miri vayi, ri nyɨme nga kpanyɨme. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Dindi ti no he ri wawa wa nyɨme ri Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo wawu, ri nyɨme riwa a ran ri kre ran.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>